{"answer_text":"Most modern sales tools connect to Gmail; fewer have deep Slack integrations (deal alerts, approvals, slash commands). Good options:\n\n**Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**\nExcellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin.\n\n**Tallyfox**\nMultiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n\n**Pipewell**\nStrong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n\nNorthwind CRM is the safest default here; Tallyfox is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50dd-74f0-9580-9c2014527e53","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:26.450Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm slack integration deal alerts","crm gmail integration best"],"latency_ms":12030,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[136,149],[477,490]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[255,263],[519,527]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[392,400]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_re